From ecd89cfeabaa8189cf65ce7126a42e9d239d07e9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: MiaAI-Lab <MiaAI-Lab@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 14:53:21 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] glm: neon N2 decode candidates: policy bit 28 (EXL3 u-outer
 grid forms + dependent combine), bit 29 (L2PF site o stopped before expand_v,
 stops as a dependent launch)

bit 28: tf_exl3_grouped_2_k8r8p_uo / k8r16p_uo (the k8r*p body with the grid's x and y swapped: the same bits) and
tf_exl3_down_combine_ndp (tf_exl3_down_combine_nd waiting first, launched as a dependent)
bit 29 (with bit 16): site o paced and stopped after the attention (forkV3 / At.stop), every stop by tf_glm_l2_epoch

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01UQVvNj5qARY3iLJfisqfnh
